      "normalized_sha256": "5ef4c64339248ffdcfe1ebbeb14f7c7490e1d2b6b56b81a6718dfd908e382af8",
      "rationale": "This is the structurally recursive step equation of vowelsTail: it defines one character's vowel contribution and recurs on REST, so it is a mathematical summary recurrence rather than an operational rule or an additional trusted fact.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-5ef4c64339248ffdcfe1ebbeb14f7c7490e1d2b6b56b81a6718dfd908e382af8",
      "start_line": 15,
      "text": "  rule vowelsTail(iCons(C, REST), _LAST)\n    => intOf(strContains(\n         iCons(C, .IntSeq),\n         iCons(97,\n         iCons(101,\n         iCons(105,\n         iCons(111,\n         iCons(117,\n         iCons(65,\n         iCons(69,\n         iCons(73,\n         iCons(79,\n         iCons(85, .IntSeq))))))))))))\n       +Int vowelsTail(REST, iCons(C, .IntSeq))"
    }
